    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Providing children with a stimulating environment in their earliest years can benefit them throughout their lives. AKU's Institute for Human Development (IHD) is conducting a study designed to furnish information that can be used to expand programmes that encourage parents to play and communicate with their young children in ways that promote their intellectual, emotional and social development.",
